  - Strengths: Broad product display, filter options by metal purity and motif.
  - Gaps identified: Minimal educational depth regarding leather grades (full-grain vs bonded), zero detailed wrist measurement formulas, lack of watch stacking protection guidance, and absence of structured leather maintenance protocols (sweat and water management).
  - BlueStone Differentiation: Our comprehensive 5,377-word buying guide bridges these exact gaps with deep educational value, precise sizing math, BIS hallmarking clarity (HUID lookup on BIS CARE app), no HTML tables (card/bullet structures only), and 6 curated BlueStone fine jewellery recommendations.

