### 5. Factual Sources & Regulatory Citations
- **Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS):** Mandatory 3-mark hallmarking for gold elements in India (Triangular BIS logo, Purity Mark such as `18K750` / `14K585`, and 6-digit alphanumeric `HUID`). Digital verification via the official `BIS CARE` mobile app.
- **Goods and Services Tax (GST) Council of India:** Statutory 3% GST on fine jewellery transactions.
- **Ergonomic Sizing Standard:** Wrist circumference + 0.5 inches (tailored snug) or + 0.75 to 1.0 inch (comfort drape).
- **Leather Material Truth:** Full-grain and top-grain calfskin resilience vs peeling synthetic/bonded leather. Zero mentions of silver (BlueStone sells authentic fine gold and diamond jewellery only).

